# ORBII Flutter — runtime env (TEST MODE).
# Only the PUBLISHABLE Razorpay key id may live here (it ships in the app and
# is safe). The SECRET key must NEVER be placed here — it lives only in the
# Supabase Edge Function secrets (create-order / verify-payment).
#
# The app also receives the key id from the create-order function response, so
# this is a fallback. Replace with your rzp_test_* key id:
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_REPLACE_ME
